:: Dad Hang Out End Late Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
Despite <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>’s attempt at keeping a smile and trying to sound interested in the things you are doing, <span style="color:LightCoral">you’re pretty sure he isn’t actually enjoying himself.</span> As you point something out to him, he nods with an overexaggerated, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wow! I see!”</span> You scowl at him, telling him that he doesn’t have to pretend. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What? I would never!”</span> He responds, giving a faux offended tone, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I just… don’t know as much about all this as you do, is all. Fun is different than when I was a kid, haha.”</span> He laughs a little too loud.<br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Dad",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Happy",
                Blush: 1,
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But would you look at the time?”</span> He says, checking his phone. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Getting pretty late already. We should get home. Still have to make your boys dinner and make sure Noah takes a bath and should probably check my email too. Come on!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Dad</span> grabs you by the hand and begins to walk you home. <span style="color:LightCoral">You think about protesting and asking to stay out longer, but considering everything, you just decide to accept your fate and walk home with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Dad" -3>>
